---
description: Internationalisation and RTL rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Locales: en (default) and fa (RTL). No hard-coded user-facing strings.
- Wrap Latin names, prices and phone numbers inside Farsi text with `<bdi>`. Prices and phone numbers use Latin digits.
- Deterministic date formatting from `packages/i18n` (no `Intl` in SSR or hydration paths). Jalali dates shown alongside Gregorian in FA.
